cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this method, the dataset, the harness, or any of the published
  findings, please cite this repository as below.
title: BlueLens
abstract: >-
  Independent, transparent measurement of "agentic threat detection" tools —
  products that claim to catch malicious behavior in AI agents. Most
  benchmarks for these tools are self-reported: the team that builds the
  detector also builds the benchmark that scores it. BlueLens exists to be
  an independent counterpart — a public methodology, purpose-built datasets,
  and results published in full, including the statistical limits of the
  measurement itself.
type: software
